        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: As You Like It (2006 film), As You Like It, Touchstone\n- People: Kenneth Branagh, Bryce Dallas Howard, David Oyelowo, Romola Garai, Adrian Lester, Alfred Molina, Kevin Kline, Janet McTeer, Brian Blessed, William Shakespeare\n- Characters: Rosalind, Orlando De Boys, Celia, Oliver De Boys, Touchstone, Jaques, Audrey, Duke Frederick, Duke Senior\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare's play As You Like It includes the fictional character Touchstone.\n- The 2006 film As You Like It was written and directed by Kenneth Branagh and is based on William Shakespeare's play of the same name.\n- Bryce Dallas Howard stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Rosalind.\n- David Oyelowo stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Orlando De Boys.\n- Romola Garai stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Celia.\n- Adrian Lester stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Oliver De Boys.\n- Alfred Molina stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Touchstone.\n- Kevin Kline stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Jaques.\n- Janet McTeer stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as Audrey.\n- Brian Blessed stars in the 2006 film As You Like It as both Duke Frederick and Duke Senior.",
